[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14222.07, "timestamp": "03:57:02", "text": "好像这家伙在她之前就做过这种事似的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14224.59, "timestamp": "03:57:04", "text": "我心想，“这不是关于做这件事的问题。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14227.269, "timestamp": "03:57:07", "text": "前。关键不在于争第一。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14232.55, "timestamp": "03:57:12", "text": "“先这样，如果这样说得通的话。” 是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14233.87, "timestamp": "03:57:13", "text": "点赞"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14238.07, "timestamp": "03:57:18", "text": "就像那个人去了月球一样，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14239.99, "timestamp": "03:57:19", "text": "而且没人知道这件事，他去了哪里？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14247.99, "timestamp": "03:57:27", "text": "这是同样的道理。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14250.71, "timestamp": "03:57:30", "text": "我喜欢这样想，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14253.67, "timestamp": "03:57:33", "text": "当然，第一个YouTuber没人会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14256.309, "timestamp": "03:57:36", "text": "了解他们是因为没人知道他们是谁"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14258.309, "timestamp": "03:57:38", "text": "是吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14260.55, "timestamp": "03:57:40", "text": "我们可以追溯历史进行推测。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14264.469, "timestamp": "03:57:44", "text": "谈谈这件事。但对我来说，第一点"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14267.429, "timestamp": "03:57:47", "text": "YouTuber永远是Kizuna和Ian"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14275.59, "timestamp": "03:57:55", "text": "我觉得，当我刚入行的时候，也像是新人一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14279.389, "timestamp": "03:57:59", "text": "就像伊恩一样，呃，伊恩，不是伊恩·印度人"}]